v 3
d surveye: SurvEye interactive Survey Solutions and SurveyCTO dashboards from Stata
d
d SurvEye creates a polished interactive dashboard from a Survey Solutions
d questionnaire preview or a SurveyCTO form definition/printable form and the
d corresponding data in memory. Supports questionnaire and custom variables,
d smart variable families, subgroup comparisons, flexible sections, filters,
d highlights, discrete-count detection, native Stata weights, runtime weight/USD
d switches, profile tables, an editorial default finish with configurable
d background, typography, corners, shadows, motion, and page width, optional
d confidence intervals, live-filtered numeric summaries, Arabic/Urdu right-to-left
d interfaces, Unicode, and optional Leaflet GPS maps with Google or OpenStreetMap
d base layers.
d
d Version: 2.2.0
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer
d Author: Attique Ur Rehman
d Affiliation: Enterprise Analysis Unit, World Bank
d Repository: https://github.com/arehman10/SurvEye
d Support: https://github.com/arehman10/SurvEye/issues
d Distribution-Date: 20260727
d License: MIT
d
